From: Runeon Contributors <dev@runeon.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase: Prepare downlevel D3D12 before Steam child creation.

Add an opt-in layout hint to the existing Steam middleware selector. Run a
fixed preparation-only helper synchronously, preserving the original child,
creation flags and returned handles. Serialize preparation through creation
by executable directory. Identity, OS version and registry policy remain the
caller's responsibility. The existing NW.js handoff has priority.
No game identity or D3D12 loader behaviour is changed.

--- a/dlls/kernelbase/process.c
+++ b/dlls/kernelbase/process.c
@@ -43,10 +43,11 @@
 
